@baseUrl = http://localhost:5038

### LINQ: filter + sort
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees?department=engineering&minSalary=100000

### LINQ: group by department
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/by-department

### OOP: cart quote with a promo code
POST {{baseUrl}}/cart/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "promoCode": "SAVE10",
  "lines": [
    { "sku": "KB-1", "name": "Keyboard", "unitPrice": 49.99, "quantity": 2 },
    { "sku": "MS-1", "name": "Mouse", "unitPrice": 19.99, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### async: sequential vs Task.WhenAll
GET {{baseUrl}}/async/users

### CRUD: list
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### CRUD: get one
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/1

### CRUD: create
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Headset", "price": 59.90, "stock": 12 }

### CRUD: update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mechanical Keyboard", "price": 89.00, "stock": 10 }

### CRUD: delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/2
